    <string name="hajj_calc_intro">Yilning Haj kunlarini darhol olish uchun istalgan hijriy sanani kiriting (yoki joriy sanani saqlang): Arafa kuni (9 Zul-hijja), Nahr kuni (10 Zul-hijja) va Tashriq kunlari (11, 12 va 13 Zul-hijja), har biri o\'z sanasi va o\'z nisbiy holatiga ko\'ra.</string>
